---
const releases = 'https://github.com/colever-Beep/BilibiliDownloader/releases';
---
<section id="download" class="download">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">下载</h2>
    <p class="center">支持 Windows 10 / 11，提供单文件 exe 与便携版两种打包。</p>
    <div class="dl-cards">
      <div class="dl-card">
        <h3>单文件版 (exe)</h3>
        <p>双击即用的独立可执行文件，适合大多数用户。</p>
        <a class="btn primary" href={releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener">前往 Releases 下载</a>
      </div>
      <div class="dl-card">
        <h3>便携版 (portable)</h3>
        <p>免安装、可放 U 盘，配置随目录携带。</p>
        <a class="btn ghost" href={releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener">前往 Releases 下载</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="note">首次运行会自动下载 FFmpeg（约数十 MB）；也可手动将 ffmpeg.exe 放入 <code>bin/</code> 目录。</p>
  </div>
</section>
